  "hasExpandPrompt": false,
  "html": "<p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">没有枪也没有炮，敌人给我们造。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不气馁要累积实力！</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">从来只有相对的弱小，用行动思考。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">要大胆创造时机！</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">只要黯淡的眼神仍会闪躲。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">这呼喊便永不沉默。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">已然枯萎的草木在倾注火。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">向九霄云天射出万丈光焰。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">刺破了阴霾，哪有神仙主宰。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">满怀期待，学习新的失败。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">伟若星辰也宛若尘埃。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">宇宙又一次轮回公转开。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">生命虽然不能重来，</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">时间的脉搏从未中断。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不论谁来妨害。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">没有人能篡改。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">这世界都期待。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">要实现英特纳雄耐尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不分东西南北和中与外。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不区分色彩。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不区分时代。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">英特那雄纳尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">这就是英特纳雄耐尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">全世界无产者团结起来。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不必说存在。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不必说应该。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">英特那雄纳尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">世界中的</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">一切的剥削压迫</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">无数的屈辱悲凉</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">都会随风飘散如同从未发生</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不再有无谓的死</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不再有匆忙的真</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">让我们一步一步，一砖一瓦，一心一意，一生一世，一道一路一起</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">实现英特纳雄耐尔，</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不分南北西东和外与中。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不同的脸孔，</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">永恒的重逢。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">英特纳雄耐尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">这就是英特纳雄耐尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">全世界无产者团结起来。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">从未曾离开。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不变的未来。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">英特那雄纳尔。</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">我建议你们不仅仅听，也不仅仅唱。</span></p>",
